    <string name="title_packed_444">Full chroma</string>
    <string name="summary_packed_444">Requires Rubylight’s full chroma option, the New streaming engine, and a compatible hardware HEVC/AV1 decoder. If the PC or this device can’t do it, the stream starts without it. HDR also requires a compatible 10-bit HDR display surface.</string>
    <string name="title_frame_warp">Frame Warp</string>
    <string name="summary_frame_warp">Shifts the picture with your mouse or right stick until the PC’s next frame shows the turn, and keeps the game’s HUD in place. Needs a PC that supports it and the New streaming engine.</string>
